WEBVTT

00:01:00.676 --> 00:01:03.036
The human and ecological cost?

00:01:03.036 --> 00:01:04.516
More jobs lost.

00:01:04.516 --> 00:01:05.676
Hunger.

00:01:05.716 --> 00:01:07.476
Families displaced.

00:01:07.476 --> 00:01:10.196
A perfect storm for crushing poverty.

00:01:10.236 --> 00:01:13.036
And even more, sadly, violence.

00:01:13.076 --> 00:01:15.796
And so it may be a challenge
to grow food today

00:01:15.836 --> 00:01:17.756
in the Lake Chad basin,

00:01:17.796 --> 00:01:22.156
but it has also become a fertile ground
for extremists to take root,

00:01:22.196 --> 00:01:24.276
wreaking havoc on peace.

00:01:25.156 --> 00:01:28.356
Sadly, touch down anywhere in the world,

00:01:28.396 --> 00:01:32.516
and you'll hear more tragic stories
of climate devastation.